  "composer": {
    "rawText": "[SongTitle: Lanterns on the Refresh Line]\r\n[Style: downtempo, rap, hip-hop, clean studio recording, expressive conversational male vocal, key-change]\r\n[Caption: Low-tempo bars for the builders, jokers, and friends who refresh together.]\r\n[Image: Cozy neon lounge, soft grid glow, community chat bubbles, gentle motion trails, hopeful midnight palette.]\r\n[Refresh Title: The Joker]\r\n[Theme: Community Picked]\r\n[Gradients: 8]\r\n[Rank: 2]\r\n[TitleRarityPct: 0.30]\r\n[Seeds: 428, A:85, B:9, C:69, D:27]\r\n[Composer Version: v2.0]\r\n\r\n[Plan]\r\n[Perspective: first-person plural, community voice]\r\n[Concept: we refresh, we return, we keep it kind]\r\n[Topic: Programmatic Art & Play → bingo nights, shared pulls, new variations]\r\n[GenreBias: downtempo rap]\r\n[StyleChange: none]\r\n[Modulation: lift up a whole step into Final Chorus]\r\n[HookProminence: medium]\r\n[Deviation: Stripped Chorus Once]\r\n\r\n[Intro]\r\n[conversational contour]\r\n[808s breathe; soft keys shimmer; tape-warm drums settle in]\r\nWe tap refresh and share the sign,\r\nWe hold the thread and keep it kind.\r\n\r\n[Verse]\r\n[asymmetric phrasing]\r\nWe chase the frame, then name the glow,\r\nA quiet pull the night can show.\r\nWe mark the squares, we call the win,\r\nA bright new set we’re standing in.\r\n\r\n[Pre-Chorus]\r\n[long-tone release]\r\nThe room stays calm, the signal clear,\r\nWe lean in close and lose the fear.\r\n\r\n[Chorus]\r\n[call-and-answer hook]\r\nWe press refresh, we press refresh,\r\nA rising light, a steady breath.\r\nWe press refresh, we press refresh,\r\nWe build it bright, we build it fresh.\r\n\r\n[Verse]\r\n[motif rotation]\r\nA screenshot saved, a laugh that lands,\r\nA wave of pings from distant lands.\r\nNo chasing noise, no empty race,\r\nJust honest craft in shared space.\r\n\r\n[Chorus]\r\n[register swap]\r\n[Stripped Chorus: drop drums to hats + bass; keep hook clear]\r\nWe press refresh, we press refresh,\r\nA rising light, a steady breath.\r\nWe press refresh, we press refresh,\r\nWe build it bright, we build it fresh.\r\n\r\n[Bridge]\r\n[stepwise triad stairs]\r\n[Half-time pocket; airy pads widen; crowd-chant textures low]\r\nWe trade our time for tools that last,\r\nWe plant the flag, we learn it fast.\r\nA gentle joke, a guiding hand,\r\nWe keep the rhythm, line by line.\r\n\r\n[Final Chorus]\r\n[call-and-answer hook]\r\n[Key Change: lift up a whole step into Final Chorus]\r\n[Full groove returns; cinematic strings lift; brighter synth top-line]\r\nWe press refresh, we press refresh,\r\nA higher road, a deeper breath.\r\nWe press refresh, we press refresh,\r\nWe build it bright, we build it fresh.\r\n\r\n[Ending]\r\n[gentle sequence]\r\n[Loop-ready fade; hats soften; keys glow out]\r\nWe press refresh and hold the line,\r\nWe press refresh and keep it kind.",
